'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Polar Patriots Premium Warbond#Page 1|Polar Patriots]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|18|notext}} and 12 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Servo-Assisted}}

== Trivia ==
* This armor set, especially the helmet, is seemingly modeled after the [https://www.starwars.com/databank/range-troopers Range Trooper] from [[wp:Solo: A Star Wars Story|Solo: A Star Wars Story]].

